    "canonical_ref": "EvPetr.2.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And when they had refused to wash them, Pilate rose up. And then Herod the king commandeth that the Lord be taken, saying to them, What things soever I commanded you to do unto him, do.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
