    "work_id": "anf-works/gospel-of-peter",
    "canonical_ref": "EvPetr.8.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And I with my companions was grieved; and being wounded in mind we hid ourselves: for we were being sought for by them as malefactors, and as wishing to set fire to the temple.",
